    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This charming and extended traditional detached cottage presents an excellent opportunity to create a wonderful family home in a highly convenient setting.  The accommodation comprises of two generously proportioned bedrooms, a bright dual-aspect living room, spacious kitchen/dining area, family bathroom and separate utility room. While the property would benefit from modernisation and upgrading, it offers immense potential for those seeking a characterful home with excellent scope for enhancement.  Set on approximately 0.52 acres, the property enjoys mature, landscaped gardens with a sunny aspect, together with a selection of useful outbuildings. The generous site offers ample space for further extension, subject to the necessary planning permissions, or simply provides a wonderful outdoor setting for gardening enthusiasts and those seeking plenty of space to enjoy.  The location is a key attraction, with Wexford Town just 3km away and excellent access to both the N25 and N11 road networks. The nearby\r\nvillages of Murrintown and Barntown provide a range of amenities, including schools, sporting facilities, shops and community services.  Popular local attractions, including Johnstown Castle, Carrigfoyle Quarry and the Heritage Park are also within easy reach.  A property offering charm, potential and convenience in equal measure.  Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch - (1.2m x .9m), Laminate flooring.\r\nHall - (5m x 1.1m), Laminate flooring.\r\nBedroom 1 - (4.6m x 3.3m), Dual aspect, laminate flooring.\r\nBathroom - (3.3m x 2.4m), WC, WHB, bath, shower, tiled flooring and part tiled walls.\r\nBedroom 2 - (3.4m x 2.4m), Laminate flooring.\r\nLiving - (4.5m x 3.3m), Dual aspect, laminate flooring, open fire, hotpress off;\r\nKitchen/Diner - (5.1m x 4.4m), Eye & Waist level units, tiled flooring, plumbed for washing machine.\r\nUtility - (2.4m x 1.5m), Plumbed for appliances.\r\nShed - (3.7m x 1.8m & 1.8m x 1.7m).\r\n\r\nOutside: Enlosed garden to the rear, block shed.\r\nServices: Electricity, mains water, private sewerage, oil fired central heating.\r\nBER: G Ber No: 119571826 Performance indicator: 385.72 kWh/m2/yr\r\nApply: Keane Auctioneers (053) 9123072"
      },
